```

---

## Successor

If:

```text
root.val > key
```

root is a potential successor.

Move left.

Otherwise move right.

### Java

```java
public static TreeNode successor(
        TreeNode root,
        int key) {

    TreeNode answer = null;

    while (root != null) {

        if (root.val > key) {
            answer = root;
            root = root.left;
        }
        else {
            root = root.right;
        }
    }

    return answer;
}
```

