# 7. Kth Smallest / Kth Largest in BST

**a2z-342**

BST inorder:

```text
ascending
```

Reverse inorder:

```text
descending
```

Therefore:

```text
Kth smallest → inorder
Kth largest  → reverse inorder
```

---

## Kth smallest — Java

```java
public static int kthSmallest(
        TreeNode root,
        int k) {

    Stack<TreeNode> stack = new Stack<>();

    TreeNode current = root;

    while (true) {

        while (current != null) {
            stack.push(current);
            current = current.left;
        }

        current = stack.pop();

        k--;

        if (k == 0)
            return current.val;

        current = current.right;
    }
}
```

