# 3. Floor and Ceil in BST

**a2z-338**

Floor:

```text
largest <= X
```

Ceil:

```text
smallest >= X
```

Do both simultaneously.

### Java

```java
public static int[] floorCeil(
        TreeNode root,
        int x) {

    int floor = -1;
    int ceil = -1;

    TreeNode current = root;

    while (current != null) {

        if (current.val == x) {
            floor = x;
            ceil = x;
            break;
        }

        if (current.val < x) {

            floor = current.val;
            current = current.right;

        } else {

            ceil = current.val;
            current = current.left;
        }
    }

    return new int[]{floor, ceil};
}
```

### C#

```csharp
