# 2. Find Minimum / Maximum in BST

**a2z-337**

Minimum:

```text
keep going left
```

Maximum:

```text
keep going right
```

### Java

```java
public static int findMin(TreeNode root) {

    if (root == null)
        throw new IllegalArgumentException();

    while (root.left != null)
        root = root.left;

    return root.val;
}

public static int findMax(TreeNode root) {

    if (root == null)
        throw new IllegalArgumentException();

    while (root.right != null)
        root = root.right;

    return root.val;
}
```

