# 1. Search in a BST

**a2z-336**

Because of the BST property, don't search both branches.

### Java

```java
public static TreeNode search(
        TreeNode root,
        int key) {

    while (root != null) {

        if (root.val == key)
            return root;

        if (key < root.val)
            root = root.left;
        else
            root = root.right;
    }

    return null;
}
```

